OL,3,GNEWSAYellow warning for rain in place
OL,4,Aacross South East
OL,5,
OL,6,FA yellow warning for rain is in place
OL,7,Facross south-east England as the UK
OL,8,Fprepares for its second named storm to
OL,9,Froll in.
OL,11,FThe Met Office warning extends until
OL,12,F23:00 BST as Storm Boelo brings more
OL,13,Fwet and windy weather, just one day
OL,14,Fafter Storm Austen hit.
OL,16,FRoads, railways, ferries and flights
OL,17,Fwere affected across Kent, Surrey and
OL,18,FSussex on Friday, and part of
OL,19,FBrighton's West Pier collapsed during
OL,20,Fhigh winds across the region.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,327,320,200,140,0,100
